{"speciesId":360,"names":{"fr":"Okéoké","es":"Wynaut","en":"Wynaut","ja":"ソーナノ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"ruby","text":"WYNAUT can always be seen with a big, happy smile on its face. Look at its tail to determine if it is angry. When angered, this POKéMON will be slapping the ground with its tail."},{"language":"en","version":"sapphire","text":"WYNAUT gather on moonlit nights to play by squeezing up against each other. By being squeezed, this POKéMON gains endurance and is trained to dole out powerful counterattacks."},{"language":"en","version":"emerald","text":"A WYNAUT loves to eat sweet fruits. It cleverly picks fruits using its earlike arms. They gather in fruit gardens, drawn by the fragrance."},{"language":"en","version":"firered","text":"It tends to move in a pack with others. They cluster in a tight group to sleep in a cave."},{"language":"en","version":"leafgreen","text":"It tends to move in a pack with others. They cluster in a tight group to sleep in a cave."},{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"It grows strong by pushing up against others en masse. It loves eating sweet fruit."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It grows strong by pushing up against others en masse. It loves eating sweet fruit."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"It grows strong by pushing up against others en masse. It loves eating sweet fruit."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"It tends to move in a pack. Individuals squash against one another to toughen their spirits."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"It tends to move in a pack. Individuals squash against one another to toughen their spirits."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il se muscle en bousculant ses semblables lors de mêlées. Il raffole des fruits sucrés."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It grows strong by pushing up against others en masse. It loves eating sweet fruit."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il se muscle en bousculant ses semblables lors de mêlées. Il raffole des fruits sucrés."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"It grows strong by pushing up against others en masse. It loves eating sweet fruit."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"It grows strong by pushing up against others en masse. It loves eating sweet fruit."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"It grows strong by pushing up against others en masse. It loves eating sweet fruit."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Okéoké adore se déplacer en groupe. Ils se réunissent souvent pour dormir la nuit dans les cavernes."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Suelen ir en grupo y a la hora de dormir se resguardan en una cueva."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"It tends to move in a pack with others. They cluster in a tight group to sleep in a cave."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"群れで 行動する 習性。 眠る ときは 洞窟の 中で 仲間たちと 体を 寄せ合う。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Il se muscle en bousculant ses semblables lors de mêlées. Il raffole des fruits sucrés."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Se fortalecen empujándose unos a otros en grupos. Les encantan los dulces."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"It grows strong by pushing up against others en masse. It loves eating sweet fruit."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"仲間たちと おしくらまんじゅうを やることで 我慢強く 育つ。 甘い 果物が 大好物。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Okéoké a toujours un grand sourire qui illumine son visage. On peut savoir s’il est en colère en regardant sa queue. Lorsqu’il est furieux, sa queue remue en frappant le sol."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Wynaut está siempre con una gran sonrisa puesta. Para ver si está enfadado, basta con mirarle la cola. Cuando se le molesta, se pone a dar golpetazos en el suelo."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Wynaut can always be seen with a big, happy smile on its face. Look at its tail to determine if it is angry. When angered, this Pokémon will be slapping the ground with its tail."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"いつも ニコニコ 笑顔の ソーナノ。 怒っているときは 尻尾に 注目。 地面を パタパタ たたいているぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Les Okéoké se rassemblent quand la nuit est claire pour jouer à se presser les uns contre les autres. En se poussant, ces Pokémon améliorent leur endurance et s’entraînent à renvoyer de puissantes contre-attaques."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Los Wynaut se agrupan cuando hay luna para jugar achuchándose unos a otros. Cuanto más se achuchan, más ganan en resistencia y lanzan fuertes contraataques con más facilidad."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Wynaut gather on moonlit nights to play by squeezing up against each other. By being squeezed, this Pokémon gains endurance and is trained to dole out powerful counterattacks."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"月の夜 仲間たちと おしくらまんじゅう。 ぎゅうぎゅう 押されて 我慢強くなる。 強烈な カウンターを 繰り出す 訓練。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il fait toutes ses activités en groupe. L’une d’elles consiste à se bousculer mutuellement afin de s’endurcir."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Suelen ir en grupo. Templan su paciencia jugando a empujarse los unos a los otros."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"It tends to move in a pack. Individuals squash against one another to toughen their spirits."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"大勢の 仲間と 行動する。 おしくらまんじゅうで 我慢強い 根性を 鍛えるのだ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ces Pokémon adorent se déplacer en groupe. Ils se blottissent les uns contre les autres dans des cavernes pour dormir."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Suelen ir en grupo y, a la hora de dormir, se pegan unos a otros para descansar resguardados en cuevas."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"It tends to move in a pack with others. They cluster in a tight group to sleep in a cave."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","t